            "angle": 0,
            "content": "考点2：零状态响应的s域求解",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.361,
                0.117,
                0.638,
                0.139
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nR _ {z s} (s) = H (s) \\cdot E (s) \\xrightarrow {\\text {逆变换}} r _ {z s} (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.174,
                0.504,
                0.194
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "考点 3：系统完全响应的求解流程",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.206,
                0.645,
                0.224
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "零状态一律用LT，零输入尽量用时域(除非题目要求s域)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.201,
                0.235,
                0.795,
                0.363
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\text {微分方程} \\rightarrow \\left\\{\\begin{array}{l l}\\text {已知} r ^ {(k)} (0 _ {-})&\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\\text {时域} r _ {z i} (t)\\\\\\text {LT} r _ {z s} (t)\\end{array}\\right]\\rightarrow r (t) = r _ {z i} (t) + r _ {z s} (t)\\\\\\text {已知} r ^ {(k)} (0 _ {+})&\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\\text {LT求} r _ {z s} (t) \\xrightarrow [ \\text {特解} ]{\\text {解形式}} \\text {时域} r (t) \\xrightarrow [ (\\text {含系数}) ]{r ^ {(k)} (0 _ {+})} r (t) \\xrightarrow [ r _ {z i} (t) = r (t) - r _ {z s} (t) ]{\\text {时域}:}\\\\\\text {设} r _ {z i} (t) \\text {解(含系数)} \\rightarrow r (t) \\text {完全(含系数)} \\xrightarrow {r ^ {(k)} (0 _ {+})} r _ {z i} (t) \\text {和} r (t)\\end{array}\\right.\\end{array}\\right.\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.397,
                0.473,
                0.413
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例27：描述某LTI系统的微分方程为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.33,
                0.424,
                0.665,
                0.443
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 3 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 y (t) = f ^ {\\prime} (t) + 4 f (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.451,
                0.547,
                0.467
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "求在下列条件下的零输入响应和零状态响应。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.479,
                0.544,
                0.499
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n(1) f (t) = e ^ {- 2 t} u (t), y (0 _ {-}) = 1, y ^ {\\prime} (0 _ {-}) = 1 。\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
