                0.528
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2) \\( f(t)=e^{-2t}u(t) \\) ,  \\( y(0_{+})=1 \\) ,  \\( y'(0_{+})=2 \\) 。",
            "merge_prev": false
