            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "【引例】",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.471,
                0.367,
                0.489
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1、微分方程的隐含信息",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.494,
                0.747,
                0.513
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(1)阶数(特征根的个数、极点的个数): 看方程的左边, 与右边无关",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.149,
                0.517,
                0.368,
                0.535
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2)零输入响应的解形式",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.54,
                0.71,
                0.559
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(3)零状态响应的解形式: 左边方程+激励 \\(\\Rightarrow y_{zs}(t)\\) 解形式一般性",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.149,
                0.564,
                0.348,
                0.581
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(4) 完全响应的解形式",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.149,
                0.587,
                0.371,
                0.604
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(5) 系统函数 \\(\\leftrightarrow\\) 微分方程",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.609,
                0.551,
                0.629
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "以 \\( y''(t)+3y'(t)+2y(t)=f'(t)+4f(t) \\) 为例：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.632,
                0.768,
                0.677
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {\\text {①} f (t) = e ^ {- 3 t} u (t)} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\Rightarrow y _ {z i} (t) = A _ {1} e ^ {- t} + A _ {2} e ^ {- 2 t} \\Rightarrow y _ {z s} (t) = A _ {3} e ^ {- t} + A _ {4} e ^ {- 2 t} + B e ^ {- 3 t}} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.144,
                0.678,
                0.773,
                0.724
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {\\text {②} f (t) = e ^ {- 2 t} u (t)} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\Rightarrow y _ {z i} (t) = A _ {1} e ^ {- t} + A _ {2} e ^ {- 2 t} \\Rightarrow y _ {z s} (t) = A _ {3} e ^ {- t} + A _ {4} e ^ {- 2 t} + B t e ^ {- 2 t}} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
