    [
        {
            "type": "header",
            "bbox": [
                0.117,
                0.025,
                0.345,
                0.043
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "B站up：信号与系统_谷哥"
        },
        {
            "type": "header",
            "bbox": [
                0.654,
                0.025,
                0.882,
                0.043
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "公众号：通信考研小马哥"
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.088,
                0.347,
                0.105
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2、系统函数的可约性"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.11,
                0.825,
                0.131
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\text {以} y ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 3 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 y (t) = f ^ {\\prime} (t) + f (t), f (t) = e ^ {- 3 t} u (t), y (0 _ {-}) = 1, y ^ {\\prime} (0 _ {-}) = 1\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.135,
                0.204,
                0.152
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "为例：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.149,
                0.158,
                0.423,
                0.176
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(1)由方程可列 \\( y_{zi}(t) \\) 的形式为：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.421,
                0.18,
                0.636,
                0.2
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {z i} (t) = A _ {1} e ^ {- t} + A _ {2} e ^ {- 2 t}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.159,
                0.204,
                0.367,
                0.222
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "代入 \\( y^{(k)}(0_{-}) \\) 值后可得:",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.381,
                0.234,
                0.615,
                0.253
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {z i} (t) = (e ^ {- t} - 2 e ^ {- 2 t}) u (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.149,
                0.265,
                0.486,
                0.282
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2)由方程和激励可列 \\( y_{zs}(t) \\) 的形式为:",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.35,
                0.286,
                0.648,
                0.307
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {z s} (t) = A _ {3} e ^ {- 3 t} + A _ {4} e ^ {- 2 t} + B e ^ {- 3 t}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.26,
                0.315,
                0.738,
                0.431
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {H (s) = \\frac {\\text {右边}}{\\text {左边}} = \\frac {s + 1}{s ^ {2} + 3 s + 2} = \\frac {s + 1}{(s + 1) (s + 2)} = \\frac {1}{(s + 2)}} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\Rightarrow Y _ {z s} (s) = H (s) \\cdot F (s) = \\frac {1}{(s + 2)} \\cdot \\frac {1}{(s + 3)}} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\Rightarrow y _ {z s} (t) = (e ^ {- 2 t} - e ^ {- 3 t}) u (t)} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.44,
                0.688,
                0.458
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "由上例可见，系统函数可约性对系统分析的影响，具体如下：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.463,
                0.537,
                0.481
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(1) 对零输入响应的计算和解形式均无影响;",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.486,
                0.799,
                0.504
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2) 可以简化零状态响应的计算，解形式中会缺少某些极点 (特征根) 信息；",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.509,
                0.851,
                0.551
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(3)零极点分布: 不影响零极点个数和求解, 但有部分零点和极点相同, 零极点图对应位置可以不画 (提前说明已约分) 或同时画零极点符号;",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.149,
                0.556,
                0.368,
                0.573
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(4) 系统函数与微分方程",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.145,
                0.579,
                0.79,
                0.597
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "①(直接、间接)已知系统函数表达式，求方程时，该系统函数直接转换；",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.602,
                0.851,
                0.644
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "②(直接、间接)已知系统函数表达式，若有(阶数、零输入或其他隐含信息)，需要额外考虑方程阶数。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
